✅ Flag:
THM{KEEP_YOUR_SOFTWARE_UPDATED}

🧩 Task 4: Developer Tools – Inspector
🧠 Why Inspector Matters

Page source ≠ rendered page

Client-side controls can be modified

💸 Paywall Bypass

A premium-only article was blocked using CSS:

display: block;


Changing it to:

display: none;


removed the paywall — no authentication required.

✅ Flag:
THM{NOT_SO_HIDDEN}

📌 Lesson:
Client-side access control ≠ real security

🧠 Task 5: Developer Tools – Debugger
🔎 JavaScript Debugging

Minified & obfuscated JS hides logic

